---
// Interactive consensus & clock playground wrapped in DemoFrame with unique con- styles.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import ConsensusLinearizableDemo from '../demos/ConsensusLinearizableDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="con-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Quorum stale reads vs. repair-on-read, and causal logical clocks" titleVi="Đọc nhầm từ quorum vs. sửa khi đọc, và đồng hồ logic nhân quả">
    <ConsensusLinearizableDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Tab 1 reproduces the n=3, w=2, r=2 race: even with overlapping quorums, Bob reads stale 0 after Alice read 1 unless Alice synchronously repairs R2 before returning. Tab 2 steps through why NTP clock skew reverses events across shards and how Lamport and Hybrid Logical Clocks preserve causal order when timestamps travel between nodes.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tab 1 tái hiện tình huống n=3, w=2, r=2: dù các quorum giao nhau, Bob vẫn đọc phải giá trị cũ 0 sau khi Alice vừa đọc 1, trừ khi Alice sửa đồng bộ R2 trước khi trả về. Tab 2 cho thấy lệch đồng hồ NTP đảo thứ tự sự kiện giữa các shard ra sao, và cách đồng hồ Lamport hay HLC giữ đúng thứ tự nhân quả khi các node truyền timestamp cho nhau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .con-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .con-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .con-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .con-demo .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .con-demo .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .con-verdict {
    font-size: 15px !important;
    line-height: 1.3 !important;
  }
  .con-replicas {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .con-rep {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .con-rep.is-new {
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .con-rep.is-stale {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .con-rep-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .con-ver-pill {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .con-rep-val {
    margin: 4px 0 6px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .con-rep.is-stale .con-rep-val {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .con-rep-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
    min-height: 20px;
  }
  .con-tag {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .con-tag.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .con-tag.is-ok {
    border-color: #16a34a;
    color: #15803d;
  }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .con-tag.is-ok {
    color: #4ade80;
  }
  .con-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .con-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px 10px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .con-row.is-pending {
    opacity: 0.45;
  }
  .con-row.is-current {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .con-seq {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    min-width: 22px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .con-pill {
    padding: 1px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .con-text {
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .con-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .con-demo .con-table {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .con-table th,
  .con-table td {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .con-table th {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .con-table td.is-bad {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .con-table td.is-ok {
    color: #15803d;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .con-table td.is-ok {
    color: #4ade80;
  }
  .con-ev-time {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .con-ev-lbl {
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
